      "id": "FAM:SF20",
      "status_as_recorded": "untestable",
      "finding": "[APPA-006] Gate G2 21/23 (91%) above null median; V1(a) 16/23 above own-null p95, binomial p=2.67e-16; V1(b) mean(D_real - median_null)=+0.142, CI [+0.103, +0.187]. [APPA-007] Gate G3 Spearman +0.099. V2a Spearman +0.288, p=0.077, CI [-0.244, +0.667] FAIL; V2b partial +0.253, p=0.115, CI [-0.262, +0.615] FAIL. Diagnostics: H_code ruled out (rho=0.933); dropping 2 absorption cases rh. [PAP-023] V1(a) 16/23 above p95 binomial p=2.67e-16; V1(b) +0.142 CI[+0.103,+0.187] CONFIRMED; V2a rho=+0.288 p=0.077 CI[-0.244,+0.667]; V2b rho=+0.253 p=0.115 NOT"
