      "id": "FAM:SF-APPS-009",
      "status_as_recorded": "untestable",
      "finding": "8 divergences, 0 scoreable, 8 unscored (player missing from Neo4j); hit rate n/a."
    },
    {
      "id": "FAM:SF31",
      "status_as_recorded": "artifact",
      "finding": "[APPM-015] Mean PPP delta lead-default +1.259 (n>=5) to +1.129 (n>=15); low-n leaders are role players with 2-3 PPP on 5-7 possessions. [CHT-017] At n=5-9 typical leaders are 1-shot 3.00-PPP role players. Mean PPP delta lead-vs-default +1.26 at n>=5 and +1.13 at n>=15, inflated by small-sample distortion. n>=15 routing-override gate judged to filter nois"
