      "id": "FAM:SF31",
      "what_failed": "Attempting to measure PPP delta for routing decisions with small sample sizes (e.g., n=5-9 possessions).",
      "why": "C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw); LIM:small_sample; RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER; apparent +1.13 PPP edge is small-sample inflation (e.g. n=6, PPP=3.00)."
    }
