  "evidence_establishes": [
    "Player absences indeed cause statistically significant changes in the 'association structure' of an offense (reorganization) (FAM:SF20, V1 confirmed).",
    "Measuring PPP for events or players with small numbers of possessions (n<15) can lead to highly inflated or artifactual results and untestable hypotheses (FAM:SF31, FAM:SF-APPS-009)."
