      "code": "SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER",
      "text": "The number of player absence events where meaningful offensive reorganization can be quantified and where post-absence PPP can be reliably measured might be too small, leading to underpowered tests or artifactual findings, as seen in FAM:SF31 and FAM:SF-APPS-009."
