      "code": "CONFOUNDING",
      "text": "Changes in points per possession can be influenced by numerous factors besides offensive reorganization, including the quality of the absent player, the quality of the replacement player, opponent strength, game context, and other concurrent team changes. These must be rigorously controlled."
